<span style="color:#3ddc84">✓</span> Tunnel online
  <span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.62)">https://amber-otter.consensus.canister.software</span> <span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3)">→</span> localhost:3000
  <span style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.38);font-style:italic"># press ctrl+c to close</span></code></pre>
